ahh, I always forget that the translation result is x5 of fanva.  {fanva}
kind of breaks the mold of lojban words that if it sounds normal to say the
english "the ____" then the x1 is probably "x1 is a _____ with blah blah
done by blah blah etc..."  (e.g. {gerku}, {cukta}, {mukti} etc...}.  I
always want to use it like:  {x1 is a translation of work x2 from source
language x3 into target language x4 translated by x5} or something like
that.

